---
description: Vue 3 and TypeScript coding conventions for this project
globs: "**/*.vue,**/*.ts,**/*.js"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Composition API only. No Options API.
- Use `<script setup lang="ts">` in Single File Components and keep composables prefixed with `use`.
- Avoid `any`. Prefer explicit types or `unknown` with narrowing.
- Use Pinia for cross-component state and keep user-visible behavior covered with Vue Testing Library.
- Read `.claude/conventions/vue3-style.md` for the full guide.
